          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"unconnected-(C41-Pad1)\") (node (ref \"C41\") (pin \"1\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The required VCAP decoupling is absent from these nets, and external loading or signaling at the connector can disrupt the MCU's internal core supply.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    },
